    "id": "art_modes-avoid-notes-everywhere",
    "slug": "modes-avoid-notes-everywhere",
    "title": "The Clash Belongs to the Chord",
    "summary": "An avoid note is a property of a scale paired with a specific chord, not a property of the scale alone — so the clashes move whenever the chord does.",
    "tags": ["modes", "theory", "ear"],
    "readingTimeMin": 4,
    "publishedAt": "2026-08-15"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You've now met two avoid notes: Ionian's "
        },
        {
          "text": "4",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " over "
        },
        {
          "text": "A",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ", from "
        },
        {
          "text": "The Note That Fights the Chord",
          "link": {
            "kind": "article",
            "slug": "modes-the-avoid-note"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and Aeolian's "
        },
        {
          "text": "b6",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " over "
        },
        {
          "text": "Am",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ", from "
        },
        {
          "text": "The Ache Above the Fifth",
          "link": {
            "kind": "article",
            "slug": "modes-the-ache"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Both were found the same way, and one line covers it: a scale tone sitting a half step above a chord tone, a note to move through rather than land on."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Direction still matters, the same way it did both times before. A tone a half step "
        },
        {
          "text": "below",
          "marks": ["italic"]
        },
        {
          "text": " a chord tone leans up into it, and that's not a clash — the "
        },
        {
          "text": "2",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " under natural minor's "
        },
        {
          "text": "b3",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Ionian's "
        },
        {
          "text": "7",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " under its own root. Only a half step from "
        },
        {
          "text": "above",
          "marks": ["italic"]
        },
        {
          "text": " sits on top of the chord tone and fights it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        [
          {
            "text": "Mode"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "Avoid note over its own tonic triad"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          [
            {
              "text": "Lydian"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "none"
            }
          ]
        ],
